free-flowing tone. Effortless legato phrasing with crystal-clear head-voice accents, inspired by classic Asian acoustic rock balladeers.\n* Backing Vocals: Floating octave backing vocals and spacious \"ah\" harmonies during choruses.\n* Vocal Effects: Wide stereo plate reverb and slight analog delay, creating an airy, lifted, and open vocal presence.\n\n### Arrangement\n* Intro: Starts immediately with bright, rhythmic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and a iconic, sweeping piano hook. Drums and bass hit together on beat 1, creating a strong, energetic 90s pop-rock opening.\n* Verse 1: Driving acoustic guitar rhythm continues non-stop. Clear male lead vocal sings cleanly over the acoustic guitar and steady bassline, with subtle piano fills.\n* Pre-Chorus: Snare drum builds up the rhythm, acoustic guitar strumming becomes more dynamic, swelling smoothly into the main chorus melody.\n* Chorus: Full folk-rock band explosion. Sparkling acoustic guitars, ringing piano chords, driving rock drumbeat, and soaring pop strings create an expansive, triumphant melody.\n* Verse 2: Dynamic drops slightly but keeps the driving acoustic guitar strumming pace, reflecting ten years of shared memories.\n* Chorus: Full energy returns with rich vocal harmonies and lifted acoustic rhythm.\n* Bridge: Acoustic guitar drops to clean quarter-note strumming alongside piano chords. As the story mentions home and son \"Tiantian\" (天天), soaring string countermelodies build up to a bright, radiant peak.\n* Final Chorus: Maximum energy. Full pop-rock band with soaring strings and layered harmonies, delivering a passionate, joyful celebration.\n* Outro: Drums fade, leaving the iconic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and piano melody to play out together, ending on a crisp acoustic ring."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", 